usr: Stands for "User System Resources".

Purpose: Secondary hierarchy for user data.

Content: Apps, libs, docs, and headers.

LPIC1: Know it holds most installed software.

bin: Essential user command binaries.

sbin: System administration binaries.

lib: Shared libraries for programs.

include: C header files for development.

share: Architecture-independent data.

local: Locally installed software.

games: Game binaries and data.

src: Source code for system software.
